{"resourceIdentifier":"4069","resourceName":"Mamuriá Grouped REDD Project","description":"The primary objective of the Mamuriá Grouped REDD Project is to Avoid the Unplanned Deforestation (AUD) within the 51,066.42 ha project area and Avoid Planned Deforestation (APD) of the 13,497.42 ha project area, consisting of 100% Amazon rainforest. The project area is located within 2 private properties, which are located in municipalities of Feijó, Manoel Urbano and Santa Rosa do Purus in the State of Acre. \r\n\r\nIt is expected that, with the carbon project, it will be possible to expand the monitoring of the area, hiring new professionals to work on the farms. In addition to the project’s ecological and carbon benefits, a proportion of the carbon credits generated will be dedicated to improving the social and environmental conditions in the project region, specifically contributing to improving deforestation control, aiming at the propagation of environmental awareness, generation of alternative sources of income and environmental education actions. \r\n\r\nThe AUD REDD project is expected to avoid a predicted 6,807 ha of deforestation, equating to 679,673 tCO2e in emissions reductions over the 30-year project lifetime (07-October-2020 to 06-October-2020), with an annual average of 22,656 tCO2e.\r\n\r\nThe APD REDD project is expected to avoid a predicted 13,497.42 ha of deforestation, equating to 2,749,747 tCO2e in emissions reductions over the 10-year project lifetime, with an annual average of 274,974 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":-8.919124,"longitude":-69.919640},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-02-06","endExclusive":"2023-03-09","endInclusive":"2023-03-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4069"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Acre"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"297630"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0007,VM0015"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"64564 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VCS Validation/Verification Body"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 07/10/2020 - 06/10/2050"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=84312&IDKEY=olksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098l116266248","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4069_10JAN2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-02-06T20:49:42.513Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82383&IDKEY=ciofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3q113606157","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing Representation_Mamuria.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-10T13:45:30.457Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_OTHER_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Other Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82300&IDKEY=miquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfc113491700","documentType":"KML File","documentName":"MamuriaREDD_APD_AUD.kml","uploadDate":"2023-01-09T18:06:05.097Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org